# Copy this file to `.env` and adjust values.
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the frontend.

# Base URL of the Django REST backend, including the /api prefix.
#
# Leave this as /api for local development: vite.config.ts proxies /api to
# http://localhost:8000, which keeps the browser on one origin so CORS never
# applies. In production set the deployed API root, e.g.
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-app.railway.app/api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
